I am in my flat.
I look at my phone.
I open the calendar for the month of February.
I look at Saturday.
On Saturday, I have coffee with Asha.
What time is the coffee?
The coffee is at eleven o'clock in the morning.
I look at my calendar again.
On Saturday, I also have a haircut.
What time is the haircut?
Oh no!
The haircut is also at eleven o'clock.
Both things are at the exact same time.
This is a big problem.
I sometimes make such mistakes.
But I need the haircut.
Asha is my friend.
I do not meet Asha every day.
I always take care of the time.
I want to change the salon time.
I call the salon now.
